            "notes": "The entire build works around loading double Take Aim bolts into squishies at exactly the same time by shooting and using updraft at the same time. This will oneshot almost everything on it's base health besides tanks.\n\nPretty standard round, if you are on a map with lots of tight corners then take the wall hacks as they pretty much win 1v1s with pure peekers advantage, especially vs Soldier or supports. Most squishies will spend this round wondering why they are being deleted in one shot as visually they're only being hit once, when in fact they're being hit by two.",
