            "created_at": "2025-09-07T19:15:31.150618+00:00",
            "notes": "Much the same as round one, except ramp the damage to counteract any survivability items and make the oneshot more reliable.\n\nIf you're down on cash as a team in this round it means A) you're going to have to carry B) you need to get the Hunter's Mark.\n\nHunter's Mark is the best catch-up mechanic in the game by far, and almost always becomes an auto re-buy for any lost rounds, because the cash advantage it gives you per kill and the advantage it gives you in any duel against a team's carry hero is just unbeatable. It naturally gives you bounty bonuses and should make you MVP for any round you are forced to pick it in.",
