            "created_at": "2025-09-07T19:15:31.461985+00:00",
            "notes": "The Seekerpoint shots here are absolutely bonkers. They provide additional Revdraw shots in addition to your Take Aim shots and STACK with your Revdraw fire. This means you can output 2 instant take aim, 11-12 Revdraw (6 auto + another 6 fired manually) and a final take aim plus 3 more revdraw downwards into a target. For reference this is something like over 600 damage into an armoured tank like Rein.\n\nEl-sa'ka suppressor is amazing against any healing dependent tanks/supports, Hunter's mark again is great if you are running low on cash. Codebreaker is the go-to here for shredding tanks and Brigitte. You want to look out for the tank 1v1 as your job is to make your tank win that 1v1 instantly.",
