            "notes": "This round we take Phantasmic Flux as the life-steal, overhealth and weapon power combined means we don't need to take any armour and a slot is freed up permanently. We will eventually get rid of the other life-steal as the weapon power directly feeds this ability and the 15-25% life steal difference doesn't matter any more. For now though, we keep to our previous strategy of maintaining either Codebreaker for armour tanks or El-ka-sa suppressor for heal tanks.\n\nAgain, bring Hunter's Mark if you're starting the round with any enemy team members being a bounty or close to it. This item only gets dropped when the enemy team is all starting a 300 or below. Heartbeat Sensor is the slot this gets traded in and out of.",
