            "notes": "The final power is pretty much whatever will help in the tank duel or 1v1 the best. Choose based on who the carry is on the enemy team. You want to go all in on weapon power here. If you're getting killed in previous rounds by only a small amount, go back in for an armour ability, doesn't matter even if it's the basic one, it will often be the difference between life and death.\n\nYour only win condition is to slam as much damage out in as little time as possible. Use the Updraft Cyclone/Take-aim combo as much as you can on squishies, who at this point are usually all in on either survival or weapon/ability damage. If they're on survival this should give you enough damage to whittle them down, if they're on attack/ability damage then they should already be dead.\n\nThis is also the round where your tank targeting abilities make the most difference. Armour mitigation or healing reduction on the enemy tank will make the most difference for your own tank and other DPS here to help burn them down as fast as possible.",
